<title>UK: VLCC in collision with bulker at Fos, France.</title>
<headline>VLCC in collision with bulker at Fos, France.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Kerguelen Islands flagged tanker Once, while leaving Fos, was involved in a collision with the Singapore flagged bulker Amber on February 25, Lloyds Shipping Intelligence Service said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>It appears quite serious damage has been sustained on both hulls but that there has been no pollution, Lloyds added.</p>
<p>At the time of collision the 76,583 dwt Amber was still connected to its forward tug and the 269,919 dwt Once still had all three of its tugs.</p>
</text>
